          "title": "You'll want to know: சச்சரவு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சச்சரவு — caccaravu — \"a squabble\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சிறிய விஷயத்துக்கு அண்ணன் தம்பிக்குள் சச்சரவு வந்தது. ciṟiya viṣayattukku aṇṇaṉ tampikkuḷ caccaravu vantatu. The brothers squabbled over a small matter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சண்டை சச்சரவு (caccaravu), fights and squabbles, is a common pair."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of சச்சரவு (caccaravu) is not settled; we could not find it in DEDR."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
