          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தகராறு — takarāṟu — \"a dispute; a row\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நிலம் பற்றி இரண்டு குடும்பங்களுக்கும் தகராறு. nilam paṟṟi iraṇṭu kuṭumpaṅkaḷukkum takarāṟu. The two families have a dispute over land."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தகராறு (takarāṟu) செய், to pick a quarrel."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தகராறு (takarāṟu) is usually traced to Arabic takrār, \"repetition; altercation\", which reached Tamil through Hindustani; our sources do not document the path."
            }
          ]
        },
