          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மனஸ்தாபம் (maṉastāpam) is borrowed from Sanskrit manastāpa, \"pain or anguish of the mind\" (Monier-Williams); Tamil uses it for a rift between people."
            }
